<title>USA: Pacific Sunwear sells 840,000 shares.</title>
<headline>Pacific Sunwear sells 840,000 shares.</headline>
<dateline>ANAHEIM, Calif. 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pacific Sunwear of California Inc said it sold 840,000 shares of its common stock to the public at a price of $37 per share.</p>
<p>All of the 840,000 shares were offered by Pacific Sunwear of California Inc and net proceeds are expected to be about $29 million.</p>
</text>
